{"id":"658350","name":"梅干菜蒸五花肉","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/658350/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"五花肉","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"梅干菜","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"梅干菜提前泡发洗净。","img":"images/658350/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"五花肉焯过水后洗净切块。","img":"images/658350/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"锅中热油放入五花肉。","img":"images/658350/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"煸炒出油脂后盛出部分。","img":"images/658350/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"加入蚝油，生抽，老抽。","img":"images/658350/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"翻炒均匀上色入味。","img":"images/658350/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放入梅干菜。","img":"images/658350/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"翻炒均匀，少许盐调味。","img":"images/658350/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"炒好后盛入碗中。","img":"images/658350/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"放入电压力锅中，隔水蒸压20分钟左右。","img":"images/658350/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/658350/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/658350/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/658350/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：电压力锅、炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}